[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Scout island under attack!</h2>
<i>"I think something is wrong here, really wrong"<br>
--=DDC=Striker </i>  

<p>After the almost forgotten victory over the Razorians, there happened little at DDC. DDC's number of Defense and Scout Islands were shrinking to a minimum because of decay. Years later, you suddenly received a message from the only Scout Island left:

<p>"<I>Mayday, mayday! This is Scout Island Delta (SID)! We're under attack by a strong force of enemy islands! Please send reinforcements or we won't make it back!</I>"<BR><BR>

<p>Arriving there, the scout island already was under attack. SID: "<I>Thanks for getting here in time. Without you I won't last long anymore, however. Hurry up!</I>"

<p>Your mission is to rescue SID and also to find out who those attackers are.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Well done!</h2>
<p>
Thanks for coming to the rescue! I wouldn't have made it without you! DDC has told me that Scout Islands Alpha, Beta and Zeta are going back to service!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Razorianreturn2

[ai2PriestDead]
<p>SID is lost. That leaves us without Scout Islands and virtually blind against enemy attacks!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You are dead! Without you, SID is lost and defeated.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]